Makes these three boss-loot choices always succeed without killing the cat who searches:
[list]
[*]Dead King: looting the Throbbing King's body succeeds.
[*]The Rift: reaching into the rift succeeds.
[*]Dead God: examining the Creator's remains succeeds.
[/list]
Rewards, boss fights and other events are unchanged.

[b]Installation[/b]
[b]Vortex:[/b] download with your mod manager, install, enable and deploy. Enable Guaranteed Boss Loot in the Mewgenics Load Order view, then launch through Vortex.

[b]Mewtator:[/b] import the ZIP, enable Guaranteed Boss Loot in your profile, and launch through Mewtator.

[b]Manual:[/b] extract the GuaranteedBossLoot folder into the game's mods folder and add GuaranteedBossLoot to mods/modlist.txt.

This is a data-only mod. No Mewjector or DLL loader is required.

[b]Compatibility[/b]
Load after other mods that change these boss events, including FewerBadEvents and Event Descriptions. Later overrides can undo the guarantee. Event-description mods may still display their original warning text.

Disable or remove the mod to restore normal behavior for future events.

